@startuml
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Payment Worker" as App
participant "PgBouncer Pooler" as Pooler
participant "CockroachDB Node 1\n(Raft Leaseholder - AZ 1)" as N1
participant "CockroachDB Node 2\n(Raft Follower - AZ 2)" as N2
participant "CockroachDB Node 3\n(Raft Follower - AZ 3)" as N3

== Healthy Execution ==
App -> Pooler: Execute Balance Check / Debit
Pooler -> N1: Forward write query to current Leaseholder
N1 -> N2: Replicate WAL via Raft consensus
N1 -> N3: Replicate WAL via Raft consensus
N2 --> N1: ACK
N1 --> Pooler: Commit Confirmed
Pooler --> App: Success

== Failure Injection: Node 1 Unreachable ==
N1 x- N1: Sudden Crash / AZ Network Partition
App -> Pooler: Execute Next Transaction
Pooler -> N1: Query Timeout (500ms)
Pooler --> App: Error (Connection Refused / Timeout)

== Automatic Raft Leader Election (<3s) ==
N2 -> N3: Heartbeat Lost; Trigger Raft Election
N2 -> N3: RequestVote(term+1)
N3 --> N2: VoteGranted
N2 -> N2: Promote to Raft Leaseholder

== System Healing & Retry (RTO < 30s) ==
Pooler -> Pooler: Detect dead node; update health routing
App -> App: Retry transaction via exponential backoff
App -> Pooler: Retry Transaction
Pooler -> N2: Route write query to NEW Leaseholder
N2 -> N3: Replicate WAL
N3 --> N2: ACK
N2 --> Pooler: Commit Succeeded (Zero Data Loss - RPO=0)
Pooler --> App: Success Response
@enduml